<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Child Safety Standards | OneEarth</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/main.css" />
  <link rel="icon" href="/assets/img/favicon_OEOF.jpg" />
  <style>
    body {
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    .policy-wrap {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 28px 18px 60px;
    }

    .policy-card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .meta {
      color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .section-title {
      margin-top: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .policy-card p {
      color: #111827;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 8px 0;
    }

    .policy-card ul {
      margin: 10px 0 10px 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .policy-card li {
      margin: 4px 0;
    }

    .back {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .back a {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #4f46e5;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .hr {
      height: 1px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      margin: 18px 0;
    }

    .fineprint {
      color: #4b5563;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="policy-wrap">
    <div class="back">
      <a href="/">← Back to Home</a>
      <span style="float:right; margin-left:12px;">
        <a href="/report-safety" style="color:#4f46e5; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">Report a Safety Concern</a>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-card">
      <h1>Child Safety Standards</h1>
      <p style="font-size:16px; color:#111827; line-height:1.7; margin-top:8px;">
        One Earth One Family is committed to protecting children and maintaining a safe online environment. We have zero tolerance for child sexual abuse, exploitation, or child sexual abuse material (CSAM).
      </p>

      <div class="hr"></div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Zero-Tolerance Policy</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Zero tolerance for Child Sexual Abuse and Exploitation (CSAE).</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Zero tolerance for Child Sexual Abuse Material (CSAM).</strong></li>
        <li>Any content promoting or depicting child sexual exploitation is strictly prohibited.</li>
        <li>Any account involved in such activity will be permanently removed.</li>
        <li>Violations may be reported to appropriate authorities where legally required.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="section-title">Prohibited Content</h2>
      <p>The following activities are prohibited on One Earth One Family:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Child Sexual Abuse Material (CSAM)</li>
        <li>Grooming minors</li>
        <li>Sexual exploitation</li>
        <li>Child trafficking</li>
        <li>Soliciting minors</li>
        <li>Sharing exploitative content</li>
        <li>Encouraging child abuse</li>
        <li>Links to CSAM</li>
        <li>Attempting to obtain CSAM</li>
        <li>Any illegal child exploitation activity</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="section-title">Enforcement Actions</h2>
      <p>One Earth One Family may take the following actions when violations are identified:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Remove violating content immediately.</li>
        <li>Permanently suspend offending accounts.</li>
        <li>Preserve evidence where legally required.</li>
        <li>Restrict repeat offenders.</li>
        <li>Cooperate with law enforcement and competent authorities when required by applicable law.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="section-title">Reporting Child Safety Concerns</h2>
      <p>Users can report:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>User Profiles</li>
        <li>Posts</li>
        <li>Comments</li>
        <li>Chat Messages</li>
        <li>Images</li>
        <li>Videos</li>
        <li>Groups</li>
      </ul>

      <div style="margin-top:16px;">
        <a href="/report-safety" style="display:inline-block; background:#4f46e5; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:800; padding:12px 18px; border-radius:12px;">Report a Safety Concern</a>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Child Safety Contact</h2>
      <p style="font-weight:800; color:#111827; margin-bottom:6px;">Child Safety Contact</p>
      <p style="margin:0; font-weight:700; color:#111827;">Email</p>
      <p style="margin-top:6px;">
        <a href="mailto:bhuprajchauhan@gmail.com" style="color:#4f46e5; text-decoration:none; font-weight:800;">bhuprajchauhan@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
      <p class="fineprint">
        This email address is dedicated to child safety concerns, abuse reports, and official inquiries regarding child safety on the platform.
      </p>

      <div class="hr"></div>
      <p class="fineprint">If you believe a child is in immediate danger, contact local emergency services.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>

